  "translation": "Na tu, ol man i stap klostu long ol, i go antap long Yisaskar, na Sebulun, na Naftali, ol i bringim bret long ol donki, na long ol kamel, na long ol mul, na long ol bulmakau — kaikai, flaua, ol kek bilong fig, ol raisin, wain, oil, bulmakau, na ol sipsip na meme — planti tru, long wanem i gat amamas long Yisrael.",
